          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Nasal blockage, left greater than right; thick postnasal drip; intermittent facial pressure, maxillary greater than frontal; reduced smell most days; mild nocturnal cough from postnasal drip."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
